Triangle of coefficients of polynomials enumerating trees with n labeled nodes by inversions.

The 54 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A052121

/-- Known terms of `flat`, starting at index `1`. -/
def flatData : List flatRetType :=
  [1, 1, 2, 1, 6, 6, 3, 1, 24, 36,
    30, 20, 10, 4, 1, 120, 240, 270, 240, 180,
    120, 70, 35, 15, 5, 1, 720, 1800, 2520, 2730,
